{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1064688/block/singleImage/3272327/df/01M7SNFCWKDNA2GEGF4F9E0N8B.jpg?updatedAt=1795084113\"/><figcaption>沙田廣源邨485呎高層戶 放盤不足半個月居二價268萬易主｜二手公屋成交</figcaption></figure><p>富堡城物業帝堡城分行高級客戶經理陳志明表示，該行新近促成沙田公屋廣源邨 4 座高層 20 室成交，單位實用面積約 485 方呎，兩房間隔，內櫳有雅致裝修，外望開揚景觀。 陳志明稱，上址本月初於居二市場放售，開價 286 萬元，放盤約 12 日，以 268 萬元易手，累減 18 萬元或約 6.3% ，呎價約 5,526 元。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1064688/block/singleImage/3272341/df/01M7SNGAZRRJ6PF9Y835NHCQJ9.jpg?updatedAt=1795084113\"/><figcaption>廣源邨共有6座，提供4,448個單位。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>單位25年升值近12倍 據了解，原業主於 2001 年以 21 萬元購入單位，持貨約 25 年轉售，物業期內升值 247 萬元或約 11.8 倍。 資料顯示，廣源邨位於小瀝源路 68 號， 1989 年入伙，共有 6 座，提供 4,448 個單位。 即睇沙田廣源邨放盤 (House730)</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T13:38:00.359138+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":371,"images":2,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T12:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T01:57:16.108420+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T13:31:17.528397+00:00","content_hash":"781a56219bada7eb7c31ccb2899afb06607d4045011c89dfebca2026033ca5a6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T13:38:00.359138+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}